{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL23MXLSystemRelationNumberO7onlyTopyA2CmF","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyTop","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyTop"}],"symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Case"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the top part of the current system."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyTop"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyTop"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlytop"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber/onlyTop":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the top part of the current system."}],"title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyTop","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyTop","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlytop","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onlyTop","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber","abstract":[{"text":"The system-relation-number type distinguishes measure numbers that are associated with a system rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the particular part where the element appears. A value of only-top or only-bottom indicates that the number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should appear only on the top or bottom part of the current system, respectively. A value of also-top or also-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bottom indicates that the number should appear on both the current part and the top or bottom part of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current system, respectively. If these values appear in a score, when parts are created the number should only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appear once in this part, not twice. A value of none indicates that the number is associated only with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current part, not with the system.","type":"text"}]}}}